	'I see.'
	R
	'Well, come have some fun in'
	R
	'Leazas if you ever feel like'
	R
	'it.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_067aa:
	ZH 1:
	'Thank you.'
	R
	'Until next time...'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0680c:
	\L_06772:
	ZH 1:
	'Thus the friend Rance made in'
	R
	'the savings cabin, Arios'
	R
	'Theoman, left on an adventure.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
