	\L_067fe:
	PF0 VAR0056:
	\L_06772:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0673a:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah... Haven’t been home in a'
	R
	'while.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_067aa:
	ZH 1:
	'Where were you, Darling?'
	R
	'Geez... I was worried.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0673a:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahaha, nothing to worry'
	R
	'about. I just spent a bit of'
	R
	'time with the kalars.'
	\L_0685f:
	ZH 1:
	'So, Maris.'
	R
	'As I explained.'
	R
	'I leave the arrangements to'
	R
	'you.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0680c:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_067fe:
	\L_067aa:
	ZH 1:
	'Understood. I’ll station'
	R
	'guards from our country at the'
	R
	'Kalar Forest to stop any'
	R
	'trespassers.'
	\L_0685f:
	ZH 1:
	'We’ll crack down on the'
	R
	'illegal sale of crystals as'
	R
	'well.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0673a:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, good.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_067c6:
	ZH 1:
	'Such a mysterious person,'
	R
	'though... I can’t believe he'
	R
	'befriended the kalars...'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0673a:
	ZH 1:
	'Also...'
	R
	'They gave me this girl.'
	R
	'Take care of her.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0680c:
	!VAR0516 : 46!
	\L_067fe:
	\L_067aa:
	ZH 1:
	'My name is Somita.'
	R
	'I’ll try to fight without'
	R
	'dragging everyone down. I look'
	R
	'forward to working with you.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0680c:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_067fe:
	\L_067aa:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh... Who’s this kalar?'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0673a:
	ZH 1:
	'She’s from the kalar country’s'
	R
	'defense force. Queen Pastel'
	R
	'sent her and said we should'
	R
	'use her.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0680c:
	!VAR0516 : 46!
	\L_067fe:
	\L_067aa:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll try hard not to soil'
	R
	'Queen Pastel’s name.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_0673a:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	R
	'Good attitude.'
	\L_0685f:
	\L_06852:
	\L_06772:
	ZH 1:
	'Somita Kalar joined Rance.'
	\L_0685f:
